  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 150eb (Premium) per dose<br><strong>Type:</strong> Street Drug</p>\n<p>Primary (1 hour): drugs, poisons, and intoxicants already in your system stop affecting you (new ones work normally); you ignore penalties from lack of sleep, discomfort, and stress; you feel amped and ready to fight and can't fall asleep voluntarily, though you can still be knocked out. Secondary (DV17): take 2 Humanity Loss; addiction. While addicted: INT -2.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p><ul><li>While addicted, switch on the \"Superjet Addiction\" effect.</li><li>Stat and skill changes are automated; caps, minimums, durations, and everything else are not.</li></ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Gear, Drugs, &amp; Frames &gt; Consumables &gt; Street Drugs).</em></p>"
